{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cEchoes of the Abyss: Descend\u201d is a DLC where you go in only 1 direction \u2013 DOWN. Descend into the depths of the Abyss to free the souls of the Children. A weird retro action roguelike, reminiscent of fast-paced 90-2000s style action adventures, like Feeding Frenzy and Aquaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/a0b81f621388966bcdb05fc12671e17b.poster.avif?t=1751295618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/a0b81f621388966bcdb05fc12671e17b.mp4?t=1751295618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A whole new region awaits you in this expantion.  More randomness, more enemies and even faster gameplay. Eat or be eaten. Grow from Prey into Hunter. Build ability-combos to survive. A real fast time killer for a few runs to finish the story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/d2ae052b850dc37654117a04a377d4da.poster.avif?t=1751295618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/d2ae052b850dc37654117a04a377d4da.mp4?t=1751295618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform XP into stats upgrades OR power-up your 3 base abilities - Shield, Dash and Scream. Find power-runes and imbue your abilities with Poison, Frost, Electricity, Melting Plasma, Push and Vortex. Strategize and create combo synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/6842cc01982b7910f8b0d6789972cbbb.poster.avif?t=1751295618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/6842cc01982b7910f8b0d6789972cbbb.mp4?t=1751295618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive hordes of creatures ascending from the Abyss and uncover secrets of your lost humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838780?t=1751295618","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838780?t=1751295618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/8daf6cdb3eb53ef3580a934aeaeb2b93f8e15a89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751295618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/8daf6cdb3eb53ef3580a934aeaeb2b93f8e15a89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751295618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cEchoes of the Abyss: Descend\u201d is a DLC where you go in only 1 direction \u2013 DOWN. Descend into the depths of the Abyss to free the souls of the Children. A weird retro action roguelike, reminiscent of fast-paced 90-2000s style action adventures, like Feeding Frenzy and Aquaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838780/extras/a0b81f621388966bcdb05fc12671e17b.poster.avif?t=1751295618\" ><so